.TH "sf2dump" "1" "1 Jan 2014" "libgig 4.6.0" "libgig tools"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
sf2dump \- Parses SoundFont v2 (.sf2) files and prints out the content.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.B sf2dump
[ \-v ] FILE
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Prints out a list of all available samples and instruments within a SoundFont version 2 (.sf2) file along with detailed information about their properties and settings.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
.B \ FILE
filename of the Soundfont file
.TP
.B \ -v
print version and exit

.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.BR sf2extract(1),
.BR akaidump(1),
.BR dlsdump(1),
.BR gigdump(1),
.BR korgdump(1)

.SH "اشکالات (BUGS)"
Check and report bugs at http://bugs.linuxsampler.org
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
Written by Christian Schoenebeck <cuse@users.sf.net>
